    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109980" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψῐ-πετής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fallen from heaven,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παλλάδιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1520.62
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lofty,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπτάμενος οὐράνιον ὑ. ἐς μέλαθρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					1101
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			v. foreg. fin.</div>
